Subject: RE: Re: [DISCUSS] KIP-1150 Diskless Topics
Message-Id: <F0408345-C583-4ADD-A8C9-760D27605AAD@yahoo.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Sep 2025 23:40:51 -0700
To: dev@kafka.apache.org
