             Summary: Optimize MetadataShell tool find command print warnin=
g message intead of throwing exception
                 Key: KAFKA-19681
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19681
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: =E9=BB=83=E7=AB=A3=E9=99=BD
            Assignee: =E9=BB=83=E7=AB=A3=E9=99=BD


When using the {{find}} command, it currently lists all directories and fil=
es. However, if it cannot find a child node, it throws an exception and pre=
vents the subsequent directories from being printed. I think we should chan=
ge this behavior to print an error message instead of throwing an exception=
, which would be more user-friendly.

In addition, since {{zkMigrationState}} is not used in Kafka 4.X, we should=
 remove this child node.



