Hello,

I would like to thank Mickael for being the RM for AK 4.1.0 release! 
Congrats for getting it out!

Given that 4.1 shipped, I would like to kick the tires for AK 4.2 :)

As always, we are looking for volunteers from our lovely committers to 
be the RM. Seems, we have a couple of good candidates, who did a bug-fix 
release already, but no minor release yet.

If anybody is willing to step up and fill the RM role for AK 4.2, it 
would be highly appreciated. Please let us know if you are interested. 
Overall, there is not much to be done at this point, except to start 
with a proposal for a release plan and timeline. It's always good to get 
the plan out early to allow everybody to plan accordingly (especially, 
if people want to get specific KIPs completed with AK 4.2).


Cheers,
   -Matthias



