Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hello All,

I'd like to start a discussion for KIP-1218.
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/NQrxFg

This proposal aims to expose the CorruptRecordException directly from the
consumer when a corrupted record is found on the broker. Currently, a
generic KafkaException is thrown, which prevents clients from handling this
specific error case.

Regards,
Uladzislau Blok.

--000000000000e49ec1063e766120--

