hi all,

The 3.9 branch holds a special significance for Kafka users, so I'd like to
kick off the next release - 3.9.2 - as there are users who expecting it,
such as [0]

Anyone interested in volunteering as the Release Manager for 3.9.2 can
refer to the 3.9.1 release plan [1] for more details.
[0] https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/11326#issuecomment-3279463828
[1] https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+3.9.1

Best,
Chia-Ping

