Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hello everyone,

I'd like to propose KIP-1219.

TLDR; KIP will add additional configurations for the controller. The
configurations will govern how much data may be sent for each Fetch and
FetchSnapshot request.

- controller.quorum.fetch.snapshot.max.bytes
- controller.quorum.fetch.max.bytes

KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1219%3A+Configurations+for+KRaft+Fetch+and+FetchSnapshot+Byte+Size

This is my first time submitting a KIP, so please let me know if there are
any other tasks that I need to do.

Best,
Jonah

--000000000000469dd5063f19e0c9--

