Lucas Brutschy resolved KAFKA-19478.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Optimize sticky assignor
> ------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19478
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19478
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>          Components: streams
>            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy
>            Assignee: Lucas Brutschy
>            Priority: Major
>
> The current assignor used in KIP-1071 is verbatim the assignor used on the client-side. The assignor performance was not a big concern on the client-side, and it seems some additional performance overhead has crept in during the adaptation to the broker-side interfaces, so we expected this implementation to be too slow for groups of non-trivial size. We need to optimize the assignor to be able to efficiently run on the broker.



