Alyssa Huang created KAFKA-19736:
------------------------------------

             Summary: KAFKA-15665 prevents safe reassignments from completi=
ng
                 Key: KAFKA-19736
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19736
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
            Reporter: Alyssa Huang


The implementation for KAFKA-15665 is a little too strict - it requires tha=
t all replicas in the target replica set be in ISR.

This means if we have a reassignment like [1, 2, 3] -> [2, 3, 4] where brok=
er 2 was unhealthy and lagging in replication, reassignment would not compl=
ete.=C2=A0



