Hello all,

There is an improvement in KIP-877 with the following changes:

1. Removed KafkaPrincipalBuilder plugin: Its lifecycle is short,=20
so adding metrics for it would be meaningless.

2. Added new extra tags for Login, and AuthenticateCallbackHandler=20
plugins to avoid collisions. These plugins now define metrics under =
three different scenarios:

a. Server component, ConnectionMode =3D Server =E2=86=92 registers: =
"mechanism", "networkProcessor", "listener"
b. Server component, ConnectionMode =3D Client =E2=86=92 registers: =
"component", "node-id"
c. Client component, ConnectionMode =3D Client =E2=86=92 no extra tags

3. Added new extra tags for SslEngineFactory
plugins to avoid collisions. These plugins now define metrics under =
three different scenarios:=20

a. Server component, ConnectionMode =3D Server =E2=86=92 registers: =
"networkProcessor", "listener" =20
b. Server component, ConnectionMode =3D Client =E2=86=92 registers: =
"component", "node-id" =20
c. Client component, ConnectionMode =3D Client =E2=86=92 no extra tags

<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/lY3GDQ>

Best Regards,
Jiunn-Yang

