Hi All,

I'd like to start a discussion on
KIP-1221:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1221%3A+Add+application-id+tag+to+Kafka+Streams+state+metric

I'm proposing to add the `applicationId` as a JMX tag to the `client-state`
metric to provide a better experience when observing multi-instance Kafka
Streams applications.

I look forward to your questions and comments.

Thanks,
Bill Bejeck

