Hi Mickael,

Thanks for the KIP.

IIUC, the pushIntervalMs value passed via the context to exportMetrics()=
 is the _current_ push interval, right? OTOH, the payload parameter repr=
esents the data collected in the _previous_ push interval, right?

I'm assuming this won't matter in practice, but I wanted to highlight it.

Thanks,
Kirk

